Z||000000||fropuff||07-30-2001||09:21 PM||||Hey guys.  I'm considering buying Shaun's nitrous kit, and the included jetting is for a 50 HP shot minimum.  I was wondering if I could order more jets from NOS.  I was thinking of starting small; like a 30 shot.  Thanks for any help.<P>------------------<BR>Fiero:  If it ain't broke, it's on fire.  If it ain't on fire, it's broke.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Pontiaddict||07-30-2001||09:44 PM||||They should be available at speed shops and mail order companies like Summit too.||||reg||1
Z||000002||JayUSA77||07-31-2001||12:04 AM||||a 50 shot isnt too big so you should be okay even with a bone stock 2.8L i think buying the 30 jet is a waste of money in my OPINION. but just so you know nitrous is great <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">right when they think they beat you you hit the little red button and your gone.<BR>J<P>------------------<BR>86' Black Fiero GT||||reg||1
Z||000003||Capt Fiero||07-31-2001||10:56 AM||||If you hit the motorcycle speed shops you can get NOS jets as small as 10hp shots.  I was thinking about having a 25hp shot set up and use it for everyday driving, IE passing on the freeway. LOL.  But to answer your question YES you can get jets smaller than 50.||||reg||1
